Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.51,0:00:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,盖伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.60,0:01:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,盖伊  你必须得走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guy. You've got to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.10,0:01:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-盖伊  没关系的  -不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Guy, it's okay. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.52,0:01:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,儿子  焦油越来越高了  你必须得走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son, the tar is rising. You've got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.23,0:01:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不  我不要丢下你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not without you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.82,0:01:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不要看我们  看你的身后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't look at us. Look behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.61,0:01:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,看到光明了吗  你得沿着光明前行  好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you see the light? You need to follow that light, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.03,0:01:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不要停下  不要躲藏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't stop. Don't hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.16,0:01:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,沿着光明前行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow the light,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.95,0:01:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你会找到明天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you'll find Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.47,0:01:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,"沿着光明前行"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Follow the light."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.52,0:01:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,旅行日志  我是盖伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Travel log. Guy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.52,0:01:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,自出发那天起已经看到了14次月亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been 14 moons since the mission began.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.19,0:01:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我沿着光明前行  但还没找到明天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Following the light, but no sign of Tomorrow yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.11,0:01:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,旅行日志  已经29个月亮了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Travel log. It's been 29 moons.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.61,0:02:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,还是没有明天的迹象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still no sign of Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.03,0:02:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒是找到了这个小家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did find this little fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.04,0:02:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他跟我一样  孤身一人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's all alone, just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.87,0:02:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他很擅长瞭望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a good lookout.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.46,0:02:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我在考虑叫他"望望"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm thinking of calling him "Watch."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.29,0:02:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,旅行日志  已经54个月亮了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Travel log. It's been 54 moons.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.79,0:02:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,73个月亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seventy-three moons.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.63,0:02:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,110个月亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A hundred and ten moons.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.67,0:02:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,200个月亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two hundred moons.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.55,0:02:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,旅行日志  已经{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Travel log. It's been...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.09,0:02:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,很多月亮了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a lot of moons.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.26,0:02:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那么多月亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the moons.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.35,0:02:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,还是没有明天的迹象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still no sign of Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.39,0:02:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,有东西接近  皮带猴  伪装模式{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's coming. Belt, disguise mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.72,0:02:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那是个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a person!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.96,0:02:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀  没错  那就是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oops. Yeah, that was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.97,0:02:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨  我是小伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi. I'm Eep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.63,0:03:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,为我自己说句话  我这辈子都住在洞穴里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In my defense, I had been living in a cave my whole life,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.14,0:03:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很少跟别人接触{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I didn't really come across other people very often,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.43,0:03:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,更别说  男孩了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let alone... a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.96,0:03:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好好想想  我们是世界上仅有的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And to think, the only two teenagers
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.19,0:03:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,两个青少年  我们还找到了彼此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the world, and we found each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.94,0:03:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,就好像是命运把我们聚在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like fate brought us together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.81,0:03:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我全家都爱死他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My whole family loved him...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.44,0:03:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,除了爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...except for Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.99,0:03:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不过最后  盖伊还是把他拿下了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But eventually, Guy won him over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.99,0:03:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-这是火  -是火啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fire. - Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.20,0:03:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们在环游世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now we're traveling the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.95,0:03:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,寻找一个完美的家园{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}searching for a perfect place to call home,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.41,0:03:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,一个盖伊称之为明天的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a place Guy calls Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.49,0:03:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,明天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.00,0:03:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,盖伊是不是很棒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't Guy amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.46,0:03:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他带给我一种有趣的感受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gives me a funny feeling,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.69,0:03:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉像胃里有蝴蝶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like I have butterflies in my stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.80,0:03:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不只是中午吃的那些蝴蝶  还有别的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not just the ones I had for lunch, but other butterflies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.22,0:03:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道这种感觉是什么  但它像这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what this feeling's called, but it looks like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.26,0:03:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这个  这个  还有这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this, and this, and this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.76,0:03:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我太爱画这个形状了  我不知道为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love drawing this shape! I don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.47,0:03:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,但感觉就该这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It just feels right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.64,0:03:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,小伊喜欢盖伊  小伊喜欢盖伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eep likes Guy. Eep likes Guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.65,0:03:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,真恶心  是不是  道格拉斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gross. Right, Douglas?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.40,0:04:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈  桑克又看我日记{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom! Thunk is looking at my diary again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.49,0:04:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,桑克  别惹你姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thunk, leave your sister alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.03,0:04:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样  小伊  分享一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Eep. Share the tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.95,0:04:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-我还没完成呢  还给我  -我不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm not done yet! Give it back! - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.16,0:04:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子们  别打了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kids, stop fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.33,0:04:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,打他  小伊  打他的大腿根{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him, Eep! Go for the groin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.12,0:04:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你们再这样我就让大猫掉头了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will turn this death cat around!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.37,0:04:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,一路上有很多阻碍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There have been plenty of obstacles along the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.54,0:04:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,但没有什么是克鲁德一家解决不了的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's nothing us Croods can't handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.34,0:04:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,后面有几个发怒的袋犰在追我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got some angry kangadillos on our tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.48,0:04:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,皮带猴  安全带模式{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Belt, seat belt mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.27,0:04:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉过你  别走峡谷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you, don't take the canyon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.94,0:04:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-知道了  -你从来没走过峡谷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay! - You never take the canyon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.11,0:04:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,《疯狂原始人2：新纪元》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.38,0:04:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,放开她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.01,0:05:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,仙蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sandy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.48,0:05:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,都给我集中点注意力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Get your head in the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.73,0:05:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不愧是我女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.48,0:05:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,击掌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.11,0:05:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-击掌 -击掌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Boomsies? - Boomsies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.11,0:05:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸总说  "一家人要在一起"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad always says, "The pack stays together."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.53,0:05:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,一家人要在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pack stays together!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.83,0:05:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,但和盖伊在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But with Guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.00,0:05:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,有时让我感觉世界上只有我们两个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sometimes it feels like it's just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.54,0:05:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我想我爱你 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I think I love you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.29,0:05:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.46,0:05:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我想我爱你  那我到底在害怕什么 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I think I love you so what am I so afraid of? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我怕我不能确定  可爱情没有解药 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I'm afraid that I'm not sure of A love there is no cure for ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.55,0:05:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我接住你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.35,0:05:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我想我爱你  生活不就是由此构成吗 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I think I love you Isn't that what life is made of? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.14,0:05:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-坚持住  我来了  -我来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hang on! I'm coming! - I gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.14,0:06:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 尽管我不想说  我从未有过这种感觉 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Though it worries me to say that I never felt this way ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.96,0:06:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,小伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eep!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.49,0:06:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我想我爱你 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Hey, I think I love you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.58,0:06:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 那我到底在害怕什么 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ So what am I so afraid of? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.00,0:06:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我怕我不能确定 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I'm afraid that I'm not sure of ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.50,0:06:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 可爱情没有解药 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ A love there is no cure for ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.85,0:06:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好  饿啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So... hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.15,0:06:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,再来一次我也还是会吃的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I still would've eaten that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.86,0:06:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  大家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, pack.
