Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.57,0:12:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你们得来看看这个  快跟我来  这边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to come see this. Follow me! Come on. This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.57,0:12:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了  你们会喜欢的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! You're gonna love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.47,0:12:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.22,0:12:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没见过这样的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never seen anything like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,妈  这是什么  让它走开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it, Mom? Make it leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.69,0:12:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这里让我有种感觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.11,0:13:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得这里是世界的尽头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's... the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.44,0:13:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,看来我什么都见识过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like I've seen it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.41,0:13:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好了我该上路了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.76,0:13:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我很高兴是你来送我  大猫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad it's you, Chunky.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.58,0:13:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是尽头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.87,0:13:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这只是开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.87,0:13:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到我们的明天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to our Tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.05,0:13:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧这些食物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at all this food!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.01,0:13:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,盖伊  你看到了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guy, are you seeing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.68,0:13:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是史上最棒的老爸  我们开吃吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the best dad ever! Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.98,0:13:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下  桑克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One moment, Thunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.98,0:13:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,在我们开吃前  我想说几句{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before we eat, I'd like to say a few words.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.15,0:13:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,用这面旗来标记我发现我们新家的这一天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let this flag mark the day I discovered our home,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.07,0:13:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,满是花朵与蝴蝶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}filled with flowers, and butterflies,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.28,0:13:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,还有潺潺的美丽溪流{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a sweet, babbling brook.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.62,0:13:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里  你所有的需求都会被满足{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, right here, all your needs will be met...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.42,0:13:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-我饿了  -马上就好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm hungry! - In a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.08,0:13:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,冲啊  他没在看我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go now! He's not looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.04,0:14:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,马上  马上  马上就好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a minute. Just a minute. One minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.59,0:14:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不  等等  等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. Wait, wait. Just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.88,0:14:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是我们的家  一个我们将{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is our home, a place we'll always
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.91,0:14:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,永远在一起的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}be together forever and ever,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.59,0:14:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不用谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you're welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.60,0:14:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我做到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.10,0:14:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,问题解决了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Problem solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.02,0:14:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,食物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Food!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.02,0:14:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这些食物长得排排整齐是不是有些奇怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't it strange how this food grows in perfectly straight ro...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.44,0:15:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想再吃东西了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't feel like eating anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.73,0:15:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,妈  我是不是病了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, am I sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.02,0:15:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不  亲爱的  你是饱了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, honey. You're full.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.57,0:15:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,饱了感觉怪怪的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Full feels weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.53,0:15:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我一口也吃不下了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't eat another bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.03,0:15:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,等下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.08,0:15:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我还能吃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.95,0:15:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,香  蕉  蕉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buh-nah-nuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.12,0:15:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,香蕉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Banana?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.46,0:15:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,在很久很久以前  我尝过一根{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tasted one once, long, long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.25,0:15:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那是一个夏天  阳光温暖地洒在我的肩上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was summer. The sun was warm on my shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.26,0:15:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,鲜花盛开着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flowers were in high bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.47,0:15:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我还只是个毛头小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just a cub.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.34,0:15:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我一口就把那根香蕉吞了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I ate that banana in one bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.31,0:15:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,然后从那之后  我没有一天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And ever since, a day hasn't gone by
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.79,0:15:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不在想着它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without me thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.94,0:15:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么味道  父亲  那是什么味道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was it like, Father? What was it like?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.94,0:15:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,无法用语言描述  桑克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No words can describe it, Thunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.78,0:15:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,没有语言能描述出它的美妙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No words are good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.36,0:15:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道了老爸  快把香蕉摘下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We get it, Dad. Just grab the banana!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.82,0:15:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧  宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here, sweet thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.26,0:16:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你们听到了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you guys hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.02,0:16:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.98,0:16:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,发生了什么  我看不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening? I can't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.77,0:16:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,它们在接近{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's getting closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.19,0:16:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,作战队形{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill circle?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.99,0:16:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,有东西翻墙过来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something got over the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.03,0:16:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,别离得太近{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't get too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.20,0:16:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,谁知道他们是什么奇怪的墙外生物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who knows what kind of weird beyond-the-wall creatures they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.95,0:16:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们就在远处戳他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just jab at them from afar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.25,0:16:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,戳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jab!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.58,0:16:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,戳  再戳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jab, jab!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.00,0:16:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.42,0:16:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,透过他们凌乱的毛皮和呲着的牙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look past the matted pelts and gnashing teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.63,0:16:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,能看到他们的眼睛里好像闪烁着人性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The eyes, there's a kind of humanity in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.93,0:16:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,香  蕉  蕉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ba-na-na.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.55,0:16:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在试图交流{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's trying to communicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.60,0:17:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,霍普  他们是人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope, these are people!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.35,0:17:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,原始人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cave people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.90,0:17:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为原始人早就灭绝了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought cave people died off years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.90,0:17:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很高兴见到你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We happy meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.54,0:17:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,真心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In hearts...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.16,0:17:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,非常高兴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...much joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.79,0:17:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-多谢  -也很高兴见到你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks. - Much joy to you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.04,0:17:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说话很流利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. They speak beautifully.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.38,0:17:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,请原谅我们的傲慢无礼  朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, forgive our condescension, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.34,0:17:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我是菲尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Phil.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.43,0:17:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我是霍普  我们是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I am Hope. And we are...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.43,0:17:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,贝特曼(文明人)一家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Bettermans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.56,0:17:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,"文明  人"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Better man"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.47,0:17:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-贝特曼(文明人)  -重音在"文明"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Betterman. - Emphasis on the "better."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.44,0:17:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是克鲁德一家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we're the Croods.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.56,0:17:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-这位是  -盖伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And this is... - Guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.31,0:17:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦  猜得好准{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow. Good guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.19,0:17:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,贝特曼夫妇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. And Mrs. Betterman?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.98,0:17:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-盖伊  -这是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Guy! - What, What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.99,0:17:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-哦  盖伊  -盖伊  盖伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, Guy. - Guy. Guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.03,0:17:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,霍普  是盖伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope, it's Guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.91,0:17:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,盖伊  盖伊  盖伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guy, Guy, Guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.66,0:18:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.04,0:18:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我是在霍普和菲尔身边长大的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I grew up with Hope and Phil.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.25,0:18:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是我父母最好的朋友  直到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were my parents' best friends until...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.92,0:18:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,哦  盖伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.04,0:18:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们以为我们永远失去你们一家了呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We thought we lost your whole family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.71,0:18:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,就在那时我们意识到  在这个危险的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was the moment we realized, in such a dangerous world,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.09,0:18:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,应该有更好的生存方式{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there had to be a better way to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.80,0:18:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wha...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.97,0:18:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那是你们家吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that your home?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.39,0:18:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那是他们家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa! That's their home!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.81,0:18:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-妈妈  -快看  爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whoa, mama! - Look, Dad!
