Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.69,0:22:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你提过的那个叫隐私的东西吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, is this that privacy thing you were telling me about?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.45,0:22:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉有点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just feels kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.95,0:22:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,疏远  你知道吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}far... you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.33,0:22:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,盖伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.16,0:22:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,盖伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guy？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.99,0:23:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,盖伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.21,0:23:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,观赏深夜窗户秀的时间到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to watch some late-night window.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.47,0:23:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,快看  道格拉斯  这家伙是我的最爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh, ooh. Check it out, Douglas. This guy's my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.43,0:23:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  猛犸象  你现在要做什么呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, mammoth. Whatcha gonna do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.72,0:23:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,真是傻得可爱啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.16,0:23:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,乌格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ugga?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.37,0:23:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,乌格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ugga.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.50,0:23:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-乌格  -作战队形{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ugga! - Kill circle!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.58,0:23:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是你呀  亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Hey, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.55,0:23:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是呀  我也睡不着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I couldn't sleep either.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.30,0:23:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么独立房间  这种鬼地方谁住得下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All these separate rooms. Who could live in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.68,0:23:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这个嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.76,0:23:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,而且哪里不太对头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there's something off about that
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.54,0:23:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那个菲尔·贝特曼有点不对劲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phil Betterman guy. Like, way off.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.35,0:23:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,阿瓜  你知道我怎么想吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grug, you know what I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.43,0:24:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我们可以留下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we could stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.35,0:24:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,没搞错吧  你居然想留在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me? You're thinking about staying here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.02,0:24:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,难道我想在野外和鹫鼠抢食物不成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I want to be in the wild fighting vulture rats for scraps.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.78,0:24:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-我当然想留在这里了  -是啊  不过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Of course I want to stay. - Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.65,0:24:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-这里很好  -可是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's nice here. - But...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.03,0:24:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你只是担心闺女会离开你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you were just worried about your daughter leaving,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.16,0:24:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们一家人都在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the pack is together.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.74,0:24:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.83,0:24:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你给这地方一个机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you give this place a chance
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.97,0:24:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你说不定会喜欢上这里哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you might actually like it here
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.67,0:24:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我非得喜欢菲尔不可吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I have to like Phil?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.34,0:24:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你得态度好一点  别惹事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to be nice. No hitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.26,0:24:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.72,0:24:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不过就算我得独处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if I have to be alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.05,0:24:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要和你一起独处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna be alone with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.85,0:24:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说  你敢相信吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, can you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.18,0:24:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这么多年过去  盖伊又出现在我们家门口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all these years, and Guy shows up on our doorstep.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.35,0:24:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们原本担心晓晓孤零零一个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And to think that we were worrying about Dawn being alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.32,0:24:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,现在盖伊回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now Guy's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.65,0:24:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这是命运让他俩重聚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like fate brought them back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.86,0:24:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,就像命中注定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like it was meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.74,0:24:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你看见那个洞穴妹和盖伊牵手了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But did you see the way that cave girl was holding Guy's hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.54,0:25:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得盖伊对她是认真的吗  那个小咪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't think Guy could possibly be serious about that Meep?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.33,0:25:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,还是叫小皮来着  还是小伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or "Peep"? Or is it "Eep"?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.28,0:25:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是小伊  她叫小伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Eep." It's "Eep,"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.38,0:25:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得  小伊可不大适合这里  你知道吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm just not sure Eep fits in here. You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.51,0:25:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,其实他们一家子都格格不入{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, none of them do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.13,0:25:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这帮土包子似乎没弄明白墙的功能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor things do seem to struggle with the concept of walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.43,0:25:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得原始人恐怕适应不了现代世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if cave people belong in a modern world.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.52,0:25:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这个窗户秀我可以看到天荒地老{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to watch window forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.48,0:25:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他们知道吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do they know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.36,0:25:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得咱们有必要让他们明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel like we just need to help them understand
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.65,0:25:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他们有着更美好的未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that they have a bright future...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.78,0:25:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,在这些围墙外面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}outside these walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.36,0:25:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,而盖伊的未来是在围墙内{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Guy's future is inside the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.99,0:25:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,和晓晓在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With Dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.83,0:25:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不愧是霍普·贝特曼  总是替别人着想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope Betterman, always thinking of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.62,0:25:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法  挡不住啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honestly, I just can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.59,0:25:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这一觉睡得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh, that was...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.97,0:25:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,爽啊  我有史以来睡得最好的一夜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...hands down, the best night's sleep I've gotten in...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.80,0:25:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,早安  盖伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning, Guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.14,0:26:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨  贝特曼先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Mr. Betterman.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.31,0:26:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,来杯鲜榨苦豆汁吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fresh bitter bean juice?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.64,0:26:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,谢啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, thank you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.27,0:26:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-嗨  盖伊  -贝特曼太太{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, Guy! - Ah! Mrs. Betterman.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.31,0:26:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,送你的  我昨晚亲手做的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are for you. I made them last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.82,0:26:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,对了  我得叫小伊起床{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, uh, I should wake Eep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.65,0:26:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,已经7小时没和她说话了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, it's been seven hours since I said, uh, "Hey."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.61,0:26:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,真是可爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.53,0:26:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,让可怜的小伊多睡会儿吧  她一定累坏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, let's let that poor Eep sleep. She must be exhausted
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.12,0:26:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-不  她肯定已经  -快看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nah, I'm sure she's... - Oh, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.29,0:26:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,晓晓来了  太巧了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's Dawn! What a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.08,0:26:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,晓晓  你为什么在这个特殊的时间点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, Dawn, whatever are you doing on this particular rope bridge
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.71,0:26:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,出现在这座特殊的绳桥上呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at this particular moment in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.21,0:26:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,做晨间家务啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My morning chores?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.43,0:26:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,晨间家务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning chores!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.23,0:26:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,太有才了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.15,0:26:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,太有才了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.24,0:27:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,太有才了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.41,0:27:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,有才  有才  有才{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genius! Genius! Genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.75,0:27:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,太有才了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.92,0:27:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,太有才了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.46,0:27:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.17,0:27:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.35,0:27:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,一宿没睡好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couldn't sleep last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.10,0:27:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.43,0:27:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我一觉醒来找不到你妈了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I woke up, your mom was missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.56,0:27:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,她该不会被野兽抓走了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't think a predator took her, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.98,0:27:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,没有  她在那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope. Found her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.65,0:27:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这个鬼地方改变了所有人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like this place is changing everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.61,0:27:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不抱团睡觉了  也不一块起床了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't sleep-pile anymore. We don't wake up together.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.70,0:27:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,桑克就知道盯着那个破盒子看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Thunk just stares at that box.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.65,0:27:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,先别闹  道格拉斯  上面有鸟儿呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not now, Douglas. The birds are on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.75,0:27:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,爸  放松点  也就一晚上嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, relax. It's been one night.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.29,0:27:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,一点小小的改变也很{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a little change can be...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.38,0:27:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,盖伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.96,0:27:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  美女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.79,0:27:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,盖伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.58,0:28:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是你  但不像你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're you, but you don't look like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.72,0:28:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你闻起来像鲜花{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you smell like flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.10,0:28:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,还有柔柔细雨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And soft rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.72,0:28:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,更像清澈的山涧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More like a clear mountain stream.
