Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.32,0:33:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,想去那看看吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wanna go for that ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.11,0:33:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,很厉害吧  阿瓜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty impressive, eh, Grug?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.99,0:33:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,一个有趣的故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Funny story,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.32,0:33:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你眼前所看到的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}everything you see before you used to be
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.16,0:33:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,原本是个凄惨绝望  尘土飞扬的不毛之地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a sad, hopeless, dust-filled wasteland.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.08,0:33:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来不怎么有趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That doesn't sound funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.58,0:33:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,但是运用智慧的力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But through the power of higher thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.91,0:33:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我设计出了一种方式{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I devised a way to get all the water
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.27,0:33:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,能够将高山上的水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from that high mountain source
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.38,0:33:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,引流至此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to flow down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.59,0:33:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那还真是有趣呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.88,0:33:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是呀  我把荒芜的沙漠变成了苍翠的绿洲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yup, I turned a barren desert into a lush oasis.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.51,0:33:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们有了水源  不止如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we have all the water we need and then some.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.05,0:33:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Matter of fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.83,0:33:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正考虑在那边安置一座{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're thinking of putting in a new waterfall feature
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.81,0:33:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,新的瀑布{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.71,0:33:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,香蕉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh, banana.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.21,0:33:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.81,0:33:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你打我干嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd you do that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.02,0:33:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉  我必须得提醒你这条规矩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. I'm afraid I must remind you of our one rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.60,0:33:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能吃香蕉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't eat the bananas.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.44,0:33:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.63,0:33:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你看  到处都长着香蕉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, they're everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.78,0:33:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你看  你放了整整一碗香蕉在那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look! You got a whole bowl full of them over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.05,0:33:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那些是给谁准备的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are those for?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.20,0:33:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,阿瓜  我们可以整天谈论水果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grug, we could talk about fruit all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.66,0:33:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,或者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.95,0:33:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你想看一些很酷的东西吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}do you wanna see something really cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.24,0:34:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.17,0:34:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  你想吃些点心吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Fixing yourself a snack?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.72,0:34:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我应该收拾一下这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I thought I'd clean up a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.04,0:34:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们昨天把这搞得一团糟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noticed we made a bit of a mess yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.13,0:34:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,别客气  我不介意的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no. I hadn't noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.77,0:34:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你只需那个放到堆肥箱里就行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, you can just put that over there in the compost bin.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.77,0:34:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,真聪明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.48,0:34:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你真棒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.65,0:34:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不希望让你觉得我们家是一群野蛮人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we didn't want you to think we're a family of savages.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.60,0:34:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,野蛮人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Savages.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.91,0:34:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,仙蒂  放开它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sandy, drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.45,0:34:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,放开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.29,0:34:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,小孩子嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kids, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.60,0:34:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,乌格  你肯定想念野外生活了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, Ugga, you must really miss the wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.46,0:34:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,对吗  像打猎呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right? With the hunting...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.12,0:34:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不怎么想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.08,0:34:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,采摘呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and the gathering...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.16,0:34:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,也不怎么想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.34,0:34:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,朝着月亮嚎叫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the baying at the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.55,0:35:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,一点也不想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.97,0:35:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,说真的  外面的生活很糟糕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honestly, it sucks out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.68,0:35:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,如果吃早饭前没人饿死  就算很好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If no one's died before breakfast, it's a win.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.52,0:35:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这里可比外面好多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is so much better in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.65,0:35:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,挺好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.40,0:35:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.53,0:35:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上  阿瓜和我考虑过  我们也许可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, Grug and I were thinking that maybe we...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.62,0:35:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我差点给忘了  这是为你准备的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah! I almost forgot. I made this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.37,0:35:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-一个篮子吗 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A basket? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.91,0:35:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  更像是个旅行篮子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's more like-like a travel basket.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.96,0:35:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,旅行篮子吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Travel basket?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.42,0:35:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  旅途中用的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, for the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.92,0:35:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,里面有水果  坚果  肥皂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's got fruit, nuts, soap,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.96,0:35:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,还是肥皂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}more soap
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.88,0:35:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,以及颈枕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a neck pillow.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.84,0:35:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  路上用确实很棒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Yeah. This'll be great... for the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.38,0:35:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.65,0:35:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,应该的  这都是为了感谢你们带盖伊回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the least we can do to thank you for bringing Guy home.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.89,0:35:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.54,0:35:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.27,0:35:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,盖伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.35,0:35:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,盖伊的家  你懂的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guy's home. You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.77,0:35:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我得走了  晚餐时候见  好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I gotta go. See you at dinner, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.68,0:36:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,小伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ahh! Eep!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.12,0:36:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,小伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eep?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.05,0:37:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我有伤疤了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.39,0:37:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你有伤疤了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a scar!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.51,0:37:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-我有伤疤啦  -好耶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I have a scar! - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.64,0:37:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,别告诉贝特曼夫人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't tell Mrs. Betterman,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.36,0:37:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,当她以为我在烈日下干活的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but while she thinks I'm toiling in the hot sun,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.03,0:37:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm actually in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.95,0:37:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我的男人洞穴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my man cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.36,0:37:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这里好热{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's hot in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.66,0:37:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,阿瓜  你脱掉毛皮就会舒服的多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grug, you might be more comfortable if you removed your fur pelt.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.70,0:37:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经脱了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I-I already did.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.87,0:37:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.96,0:37:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  这是一个父亲躲避家庭喧嚣的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's a place a father can escape the chaos of family life.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.63,0:37:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,放松自己  和兄弟在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax, hang with his bros,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.22,0:37:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他有兄弟的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if bros he has.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.80,0:37:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,再来杯鲨奶不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another shark milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.47,0:37:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,因此  你来这是为了躲避你的家人吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you come in here to hide from your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.22,0:37:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不是躲避  是帮助  我在帮助我的家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not hide, help. I help my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.48,0:38:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,所以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.43,0:38:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这为什么是帮助你的家人呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how does this help your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.94,0:38:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,问得好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.40,0:38:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这找到了解决我家最大问题的办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is where I find solutions to my family's biggest problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.24,0:38:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.49,0:38:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那么  感到放松了  舒服了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, feeling relaxed? Comfortable?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.12,0:38:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,易受暗示影响了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Susceptible to suggestion?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.50,0:38:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,大块头  你有什么心事吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your problem, big guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.17,0:38:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有心事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.26,0:38:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,阿瓜  别这样  我看你整天愁眉苦脸的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Grug. I've seen you moping around.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.80,0:38:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么心事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.93,0:38:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我很热  这就是我的心事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm hot. That-That's my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.01,0:38:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,叩叩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knock, knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.47,0:38:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,大块头  我在敲你的心门呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm knocking on the door, big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.75,0:38:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,开门吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.22,0:38:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.52,0:38:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,向我敞开心扉吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.43,0:38:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.85,0:38:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,和我分享吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Share with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.43,0:38:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想  我好热{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh-uh. I don't wanna. I'm hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.11,0:38:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我你的心事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me your problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.48,0:38:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有心事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.99,0:38:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你才有呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.53,0:38:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我你的心事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me your problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.52,0:38:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-我不  -告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't... - Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.62,0:38:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢这里  可以了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like it here, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.79,0:38:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我的家人都分开了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My pack's all split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.99,0:38:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,没人和我一起抱团睡觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no one to sleep-pile with.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.66,0:38:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你不让我吃香蕉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't let me eat bananas.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.83,0:39:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,盖伊给了小伊一块石头  他亲了我的手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guy gave Eep a rock. He kissed my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.12,0:39:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他们正计划离开我们的家庭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're planning on leaving the pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.92,0:39:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,还有我一点都不喜欢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I don't like you at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.08,0:39:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,有点意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm. Now, that's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.72,0:39:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我只是需要更好地了解你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, maybe I just need to get to know you better.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.89,0:39:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不  不是那个  跟我说说小伊和盖伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not that. The part about Eep and Guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.67,0:39:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,盖伊想带走我的女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Guy's trying to take my daughter away.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.14,0:39:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,父亲对父亲  我也担心我的女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father to father, I worry about my daughter too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.35,0:39:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,在盖伊回来之前  她很孤单{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was so lonely before Guy came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.19,0:39:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.40,0:39:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好像盖伊是一切的问题所在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's almost like Guy's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.99,0:39:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下  你是那个意思吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. Are you saying what I think you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.41,0:39:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,对  不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.28,0:39:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道  太热了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.95,0:39:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you suggesting...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.70,0:39:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们把盖伊留在这{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we take Guy off your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.68,0:39:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这样晓晓就不会孤单了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so Dawn isn't lonely,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.46,0:39:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,而小伊也会回到你们家人身边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Eep stays with you, with your pack?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.45,0:39:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我有这么说吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.30,0:39:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,阿瓜  这真是个好主意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, Grug, that's a truly great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.34,0:39:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你做到啦  你解决了我们俩的问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've done it! You've solved both our problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.30,0:39:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,没有吧  真的假的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.14,0:39:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们说好咯  兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, we have a deal, bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.48,0:39:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,成交{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.11,0:40:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,乌格  我刚刚和菲尔玩得很开心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Ugga! I just had the best time with Phil!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.28,0:40:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你看看我  站的笔直  思如泉涌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me. Standing up straight, got lots of ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.49,0:40:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,菲尔是个很好的倾听者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Phil's a good listener.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.16,0:40:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他知道什么是好主意  当他听到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knows a smart idea when he hears... one.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.99,0:40:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,贝特曼一家想让我们离开  把盖伊留在这{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Bettermans want us to leave without Guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.84,0:40:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, um... You think so, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.40,0:40:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好像我们真的会那样做一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As if we would ever do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.21,0:40:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-好吧  -盖伊是我们家的一员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well... - Guy's a member of our pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.22,0:40:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,勉强算是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.30,0:40:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你能想象到那会对小伊造成什么影响吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And can you imagine what that would do to Eep?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.88,0:40:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,她绝对会受到沉重的打击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would absolutely destroy her!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.68,0:40:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,也就刚开始吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, initially.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.22,0:40:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,在他们眼里  我们只是头脑简单的原始人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They think we're just simple cave people.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.31,0:40:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,以为我们会愚蠢到用一个水果篮交换盖伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That we're so stupid, we'd trade Guy for a fruit basket.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.31,0:40:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,然后她还想让我觉得那是我自己的想法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then she tried to make me think it was my idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.72,0:40:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-这真是个好主意  -贝特曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That is a great idea. - Betterman.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.53,0:40:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,就好像我们真的会那样做一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As if we'd ever do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.44,0:40:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-那我们说好咯  -贝特曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So we have a deal? - Betterman.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.70,0:40:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他们肯定认为我们蠢得要死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They must think we're pretty stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.78,0:40:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你做到了  阿瓜  你很聪明  一点也不傻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've done it, Grug. Thinking man. You're not stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.91,0:40:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-贝特曼  -贝特曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Betterman! - Betterman!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.16,0:40:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-贝特曼  -贝特曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Betterman! - Betterman!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.96,0:41:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我们应该低调点  亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we should take it down a notch, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.59,0:41:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要专注  我们要带着盖伊离开这{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta focus. We've gotta get Guy and get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.22,0:41:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,可以  但是首先{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. But first,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.93,0:41:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去做一件我很久很久之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's something I've wanted to do
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.24,0:41:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,就想做的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for a really, really long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.68,0:41:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不敢相信他们居然还留着这些旧相册{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah. I can't believe they kept these old picture albums.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.69,0:41:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这是贝特曼一家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the Bettermans.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.57,0:41:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我妈  这是我爸  这是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, this is my mom, this is my dad, and that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.99,0:41:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道  那时候我很瘦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I get it. I was skinny.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.95,0:41:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这地方很棒吧  皮带猴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's pretty great here, huh, Belt?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.23,0:42:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我爸吗  掩护我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that my dad? Hide me!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.81,0:42:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,贝特曼先生吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Betterman?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.48,0:42:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,什么贝特曼先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Mr. Betterman"?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.93,0:42:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,只是盖伊  你好啊  盖伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just Guy. Hi, Guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.36,0:42:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨  帅哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.65,0:42:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-你去哪了  -带大猫兜风去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where'd you go? - Took Chunky for a joyride.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.16,0:42:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-兜风  -兜风{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Joyride! - Joyride?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.37,0:42:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们跳来跳去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We rolled the death...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.91,0:42:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-在围墙外  -大猫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Outside the wall. - ...cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.41,0:42:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你带晓晓在围墙外面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You took Dawn for a joyride
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.92,0:42:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-兜风吗  -对啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- outside the wall? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.71,0:42:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,贝特曼夫妇不想让晓晓去围墙外面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Bettermans don't want Dawn outside the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.96,0:42:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他们搭建围墙是有原因的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They built the wall for a reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.67,0:42:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,为了保证大家的安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you know, to keep everyone safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.46,0:42:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,盖伊  放松点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guy, relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.88,0:42:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  盖伊  没什么大不了的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Guy, take it down low.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.26,0:42:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,她怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.39,0:42:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,只是中了蜂毒之后的正常反应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a reaction to the bee venom.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.22,0:42:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-蜂毒  -蜂毒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bee venom? - Bee venom!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.52,0:42:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.77,0:42:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-只是被蜜蜂小蛰了一下  -小吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's just a little bee sting. - "Little"?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.69,0:42:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你没资格管我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you're not the boss of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.77,0:42:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这是很严重的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a very severe...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.36,0:42:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,小伊  这是很严重的蜂蛰伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eep, this is a very severe bee sting!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.32,0:42:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-这是很严重的蜂蛰伤  -她没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- "This is a very severe bee sting." - She's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.53,0:42:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不不  她不太好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. She's not fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.91,0:43:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-我没事  -晓晓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm fine. - Dawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.28,0:43:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,小伊  这样一点也不好  她可能受了重伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eep, that was not smart. She could have been seriously hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.46,0:43:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要反思一下你做的这些事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta think about these things!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.46,0:43:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么表现出这副样子  你喜欢冒险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you acting like this? You like adventures.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.53,0:43:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不不  我喜欢活着  现在情况不同了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No. I like not dying. Things are different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.21,0:43:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,但她需要出去看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But she needed to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.97,0:43:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,她就和以前的我一样  这里是她的洞穴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's just like me. This is her cave!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.64,0:43:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不  她跟你不一样  这里不是她的洞穴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, she's not like you. This is not her cave!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.26,0:43:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,她不是洞穴妹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's not a cave girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.60,0:43:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,洞穴妹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Cave girl"?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.06,0:43:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他说洞穴妹是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does he mean by "cave girl"?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.53,0:43:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我让他看看什么是洞穴妹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll give him a cave girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.79,0:43:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信你们都很有食欲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trust you've all brought your appetites.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.33,0:43:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,霍普大厨辛苦了一整天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chef Hope's been working hard all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.57,0:43:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这个真好吃  贝特曼妈妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is so good, Mrs. Better-mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.21,0:43:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你吃的是插花{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're eating the flower arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.09,0:44:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,阿瓜  乌格  你们要吃点什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, Grug, Ugga, what can we offer you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.01,0:44:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, we're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.22,0:44:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在来的路上吃了点东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we ate a little something on the way over.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.89,0:44:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呦  原谅我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oops. Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.48,0:44:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.13,0:44:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.47,0:44:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,盖伊和晓晓在那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! Guy and Dawn are here...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.02,0:44:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...together.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.44,0:44:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你能做到吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You good to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.90,0:44:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,只要不让大家看到你的巨手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just try to keep your giant hand out of sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.03,0:44:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.16,0:44:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎  小伊  你的座位在这  外婆的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, welcome, Eep. Your seat is over here, next to...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.61,0:44:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,旁边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gran.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.92,0:44:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的事没完  你叫我洞穴妹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not done. You called me a cave girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.88,0:44:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但你确实住在洞穴里啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But y-y-you are a cave girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.92,0:44:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,但你说的洞穴妹  可是个贬义词{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you said "cave girl" like it's a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.09,0:44:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,原始人有什么问题吗  盖伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong with cave people, Guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.35,0:44:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,原始人没什么不好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing wrong with cave people.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.18,0:44:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,需要我给你拿条毛巾或者餐具什么的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I get you a towel or a utensil or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.85,0:44:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.19,0:44:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要这副样子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you acting like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.61,0:44:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是要表现的像个洞穴妹  盖伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just acting like a cave girl, Guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.85,0:44:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,但我想你现在已经对这些不满意了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I guess that's not good enough for you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.69,0:44:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我可从来没说过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.82,0:45:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,阿瓜  让我们趁这个时候谈谈你的好主意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grug, let's take this moment to talk about your great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.66,0:45:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.82,0:45:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,阿瓜认为  而且我也同意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grug felt, and I concurred,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.70,0:45:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,盖伊应该跟他的同类  现代人在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Guy should be with his kind of people, evolved people.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.08,0:45:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,小伊应该和她的同类在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Eep should stay with her kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.87,0:45:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-因此我们做了交易  -你再说一遍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So we made a deal. - Say again?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.92,0:45:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么交易  -他的交易{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What deal? - His deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.79,0:45:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-你的主意  -是你的主意吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your idea. - Your idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.88,0:45:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,盖伊和我们在一起  小伊和她家人在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guy stays with us, and Eep stays with her pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.38,0:45:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,是阿瓜说的  不是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grug's words, not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.76,0:45:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-你想甩掉我吗  -真的吗  爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You tried to get rid of me? - Really, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.18,0:45:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,没有  宝贝  我没这样想过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Honey, I don't think that.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.68,0:45:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是他让我以为我是这么想的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, he made me think that I thought that.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.06,0:45:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他耍了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He tricked me!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.56,0:45:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是他把我带到他那愚蠢的男人洞穴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He took me into his stupid secret man cave,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.69,0:45:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,然后他耍了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he tricked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.06,0:45:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,什么是男人洞穴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's a man cave?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.48,0:45:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,一个地方  让我能躲避{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a place I go to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.27,0:45:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,躲避什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Away from what?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.57,0:45:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,躲避你  笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Away from you! Duh!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.65,0:45:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么  -我们都是这么想的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - We're all thinking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.82,0:45:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-你怎么敢  -你怎么敢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How dare you? - How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.78,0:45:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩怎么敢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How dare the both of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.33,0:45:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你们居然要把我介绍给盖伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're trying to fix me up with Guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.91,0:45:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你的手怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.41,0:45:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我被蜜蜂蛰到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. I got stung by a bee. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.29,0:45:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,在围墙外面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Outside the wall. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.00,0:45:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-你去围墙外面了吗  -围墙外面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You went outside the wall? - Outside the wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.50,0:45:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-这都是你们的错  -是吗  我们的错吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is all your fault! - Oh! Our fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.80,0:45:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我能说句话吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.88,0:46:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-不能  -好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No! - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.09,0:46:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我不敢相信你居然真的答应了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe you actually made that deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.26,0:46:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-他们对你做了什么  -我有伤疤了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-What did they do to you? - I got scars.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.80,0:46:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.10,0:46:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那里非常热{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was really hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.56,0:46:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我喝了一肚子鲨奶  还光着身子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was full of shark milk. I was naked!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.43,0:46:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么  菲尔  为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, Phil? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.10,0:46:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,因为隐私能促进个性发展  我们的家训{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because privacy promotes individuality! Unofficial motto!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.02,0:46:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  看来我们都有不为人知的秘密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, kiddo, looks like we all have something to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.49,0:46:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,够了  走吧盖伊  我们离开这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it! Come on, Guy. We're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.82,0:46:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.84,0:46:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,是你先想要甩开我的  阿瓜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, you wanted to get rid of me, Grug,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.54,0:46:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你又想我跟你一起走了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and now you want me to come with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.33,0:46:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你还想把我女儿拐走呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were trying to take my daughter away!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.91,0:46:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,承诺我宝贝女儿什么蝴蝶和潺潺溪流{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Promising my baby girl butterflies and babbling brooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.58,0:46:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了吧  我就知道你在偷听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see? I knew you were listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.42,0:46:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你们这些人之间一点隐私都没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no privacy with you people.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.38,0:46:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,哦  你是说我们这些原始人吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you mean cave people?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.47,0:46:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是这个意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.63,0:46:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我在陈述事实  小伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Positives, Eep, that's all I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.83,0:46:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这里的很多东西都更好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lots of things here are better.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.76,0:46:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-更好吗  -比如不用挨饿  不用抱团睡觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- "Better"? - Like not starving, no sleep pile.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.14,0:46:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,抱团睡觉有什么不好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong with the sleep pile?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.96,0:46:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,得了吧  小伊  抱团睡觉都是气味{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on, Eep! The sleep pile reeks!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.48,0:46:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那是爱的气味{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reeks of love!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.81,0:47:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊  至少我闻起来像我自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, at least I smell like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.90,0:47:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我甚至不知道你闻起来像什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't even know what you smell like.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.11,0:47:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,花儿和细雨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flowers and soft rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.78,0:47:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在都不认得你是谁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't even know who you are anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.70,0:47:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,一身香草味  脖子上还带着难看的岩石{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With your vanilla and your stupid neck rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.83,0:47:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,都是因为这里  这个地方简直是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's this place. This place is...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.62,0:47:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,家  这个地方是家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home! This place is home!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.75,0:47:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Home"?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.83,0:47:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我爸妈想让我寻找的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the place my parents wanted me to find!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.50,0:47:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这里就是明天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.00,0:47:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那显然我不属于这个明天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, clearly, I don't belong in this Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.68,0:47:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我要走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.35,0:47:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你要跟我一起走吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you coming with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.43,0:47:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.39,0:47:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.06,0:47:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那我猜我们俩拥有截然不同的明天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I guess we have two different Tomorrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.87,0:47:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,小伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eep.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.53,0:48:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那么  谁想吃甜点吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, who's ready for dessert?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.96,0:48:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉过你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.17,0:48:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不饿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're not hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.71,0:48:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你吃了一个香蕉吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ate a banana?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.34,0:48:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不不  我们吃了所有的香蕉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nuh-uh. We ate all the bananas.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.71,0:48:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那是不可能的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.76,0:48:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可是原始人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not for cave people.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.35,0:48:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你干了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.06,0:48:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,只是香蕉而已  菲尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're just bananas, Phil.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.15,0:48:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,"只是香蕉"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Just bananas"?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.17,0:48:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,她说"只是香蕉"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Just bananas," she says!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.69,0:48:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我就只有这一条规矩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was my one rule!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.23,0:48:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  我们还没完呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, we're not done.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.90,0:48:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我还有很多话要跟你说的呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was more I was planning on saying to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.95,0:48:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,贝特曼妈妈  我还是去窗户那边吃甜点吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Better-mom, I'll just take my dessert at the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.78,0:48:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你在逗我吗  我才跟她家人住了多久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You kidding me? I've lived with her family for how long?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.00,0:48:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,身上  身上充满污垢  浑身气味{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With the... With the dirt and the smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.07,0:48:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,小伊  小伊  是你吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eep? Eep, is that... you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.13,0:48:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道他怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.18,0:48:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-你打他了吗  -没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you hit him? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.55,0:48:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我是想打来着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.80,0:48:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这些香蕉是我们生存的关键{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bananas were key to our survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.18,0:49:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这些香蕉保护我们免受伤害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bananas were keeping us safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.69,0:49:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,免受谁的伤害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Safe from what?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.40,0:49:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,它来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's here...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.86,0:49:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,来拿香蕉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the bananas!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.53,0:49:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么  菲尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is, Phil?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.99,0:49:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,它每晚都会来  持续很久了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has come every night for 100 moons or more.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.95,0:49:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我发现香蕉是唯一能阻止它的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found bananas are the only thing that keeps it at bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.21,0:49:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,墙那边是什么  菲尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's on the other side of the wall, Phil?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.05,0:49:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,一晚又一晚  它永远拿不够{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Night after night, it was never enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.31,0:49:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,它想要它的香蕉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wants its bananas!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.31,0:49:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,墙那边到底是什么  菲尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's behind the wall, Phil?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.19,0:49:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,它是什么  菲尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it, Phil?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.02,0:49:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-它拿香蕉做什么  -它是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are the bananas for?  - What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.11,0:49:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.17,0:50:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不过就是一只小拳猴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a little punch monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.88,0:50:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我要走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.67,0:50:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直在给它香蕉吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just kept giving it bananas?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.47,0:50:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  等等  让我缓一缓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, wait. Let me understand something.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.35,0:50:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你压根不知道你在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had no idea you were working...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.89,0:50:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,为一只小不点猴子打工吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for an itty-bitty monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.06,0:50:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,给了他这么多年的香蕉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Giving it bananas for years!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.75,0:50:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这可不好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.38,0:50:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不要  不要  离我远点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no! Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.34,0:50:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,菲尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phil!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.38,0:50:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托  拜托  快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.85,0:51:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,道格拉斯  那些花不适合我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Douglas, those flowers did not agree with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.94,0:51:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我错过什么了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd I miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.44,0:51:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  贝特曼妈妈  那里之前不是有堵墙吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Mrs. Better-mom, wasn't there a wall there before?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.20,0:51:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,菲尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phil?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.28,0:51:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-爸爸  -盖伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dad? - Guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.41,0:51:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,阿瓜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grug?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.33,0:51:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.67,0:51:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,墙不见了  菲尔不见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The wall is gone. Phil's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.21,0:51:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天哪  有东西把他抓走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my gosh. Something has taken him,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.21,0:51:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,把他们全部抓走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}taken all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.34,0:51:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.71,0:51:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,没找到他们  但我找到了这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sign of them. But I did find this though.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.09,0:51:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-那不是我的篮子吗  -眼神不错啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that my basket? - Good eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.80,0:51:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,仙蒂能通过这个追踪他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sandy can track them with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.14,0:51:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,仙蒂  开工{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sandy, seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.64,0:51:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.73,0:51:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你们去找他们  我和晓晓待在这里修墙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys go, and Dawn and I will stay here and fix the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.77,0:51:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,或者  晓晓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or better yet, Dawn,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.84,0:51:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你回避难小屋躲起来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let's get you back inside your panic cubby.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.11,0:51:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上  我想我们能挤一挤躲在里面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, I think we can both fit if we suck it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.86,0:51:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,她闻到味道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's got the scent.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.20,0:51:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,抓走他们的家伙一定还没走远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever took them couldn't have gotten far.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.03,0:52:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.83,0:52:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going too.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.91,0:52:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,晓晓  你说什么呢  我们和他们不一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dawn, listen to yourself! We are not like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.50,0:52:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸需要我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad needs us.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.08,0:52:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  晓晓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. Dawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.12,0:52:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,晓晓  你会需要这个旅行篮子的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dawn, you'll need the travel basket.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.30,0:52:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,里面有个颈枕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has a neck pillow.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.17,0:52:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要把我们带去哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you taking us?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.97,0:52:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.59,0:52:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们要吃我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're going to eat us,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.64,0:52:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,先把那胖子吃了吧  是他吃了你们的香蕉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you should eat the fat one first. He ate your bananas.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.52,0:52:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会是在怪我吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, don't you blame me for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.31,0:52:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-这都是你的错  -我的错吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is all your fault! - My fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.35,0:52:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你评评理  盖伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him, Guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.77,0:52:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,她说我变了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She says I changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.65,0:52:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有变  我本来就是这样  宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't change! This is the real me, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.44,0:52:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂吗  你懂我在说什么吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know? You know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.45,0:52:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到的就是所有  就是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you see, that's what you get. That's what you...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.57,0:52:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这呢  刚刚不知道你去哪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you are. I lost you for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.45,0:52:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,总之  我不需要任何人  压根不需要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, I don't need anybody. No one at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.23,0:52:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  和你聊也没用  反正你也不会说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ow! Fine! Wasn't much of a conversation anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.46,0:52:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,看来就只有我和我的想法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess it's just me with my thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.58,0:52:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,旅行日志{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Travel log.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.58,0:52:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.92,0:52:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,确切来说  我在一块木头里旅行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Literally, I'm traveling in a log.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.37,0:52:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,已经过去挺久了  来更新一下日志{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, it's been a while. A little update.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.55,0:53:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,还记得明天吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember that Tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.26,0:53:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那个我花了一辈子追寻的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, the one I spent my whole life looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.05,0:53:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  结果啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, turns out,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.10,0:53:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱的女孩对它一点也不感兴趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the girl I love wants nothing to do with it...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.89,0:53:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,对我也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.98,0:53:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,女人的心  海底的针{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Girls, very, very complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.73,0:53:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的日记  是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dear diary. Hey, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.56,0:53:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,还记得我之前说过命运吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember what I said about fate?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.65,0:53:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  命运非常愚蠢  还是个骗子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, fate's dumb and a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.57,0:53:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,命运觉得他高你一等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fate thinks it's better than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.86,0:53:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,命运想要和{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fate wants to stay with...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.99,0:53:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,贝特曼一家  他们太酷了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Bettermans! They're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.43,0:53:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说  你看到他们的树屋了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, have you seen their tree house?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.62,0:53:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,住在树上有什么好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's so great about living in a tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.25,0:53:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,淋浴  速燃火堆  吃不完的食物  还有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Showers, instant fire, so much food, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.79,0:53:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,隐私{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Privacy."
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.29,0:53:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  这事很明显了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, one thing's clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.71,0:53:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们结束了  -结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's over! - over!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.34,0:53:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-就这样吧  -就这样吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fine! - Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.55,0:53:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-谁在乎呢  -我才不在乎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who cares? - Not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.60,0:53:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.38,0:53:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这外面好亮啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's so bright out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.35,0:53:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想看着窗户{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just need to watch the window for a...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.93,0:53:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,就看一分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just need to watch it for a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.36,0:54:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  那是我的旅行篮子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, my travel basket!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.36,0:54:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,旅行窗户{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Travel window.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.16,0:54:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,乌格  你能让你儿子把他的脏手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ugga, can you tell your son to keep
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.01,0:54:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,从我的东西上拿开吗  拜托了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}his grubby hands off my stuff, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.16,0:54:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,听着  我对晚餐时发生的事感到很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I feel really bad about what happened at dinner
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.95,0:54:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸妈  你  还有盖伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with my parents, and you, and Guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.12,0:54:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托  我没事  这都过去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, I'm good. It's in the past!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.34,0:54:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂的  盖伊和我很不一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Guy and I, we're too different.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.26,0:54:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  你和我也很不一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you and I are different,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.44,0:54:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们相处的很好  对吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we get along great, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.93,0:54:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.39,0:54:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但是  那很复杂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's-it's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.72,0:54:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个男生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.39,0:54:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is... um...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.05,0:54:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,很愚蠢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.09,0:54:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,所以说  这不一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, it's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.90,0:54:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了  男孩问题吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter? Boy problems?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.40,0:54:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,在我们那个时代  可没有男孩问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, in my day, we didn't have boy problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.82,0:54:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们没有男孩  没有男人  也没衣服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because we didn't have any boys, or men, or clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.66,0:54:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是女武士部落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were a warrior tribe of wimmins.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.58,0:54:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,雷霆姐妹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Thunder Sisters!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.54,0:54:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,什么是雷霆姐妹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's a Thunder Sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.54,0:54:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,只是外婆的过时睡前故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just Gran's old bedtime stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.42,0:55:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,真实故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}True stories!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.75,0:55:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,够了  晓晓  别和这疯女人说话了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Dawn, stop talking to the crazy lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.76,0:55:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不会真的要穿过这里吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We aren't actually gonna cross that, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.30,0:55:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要过去  仙蒂追踪到了气味{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Sandy's tracking the scent.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.26,0:55:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  肯定有别的路的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there's gotta be another way. You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.72,0:55:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,一条既平坦又没有陆鲨出没的路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe one that's stable and not infested with land sharks!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.84,0:55:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不如这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell you what,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.76,0:55:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你来负责"礼物篮子"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you be in charge of gift baskets,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.01,0:55:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我来负责找到男人们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'll be in charge of tracking the men.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.15,0:55:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cross!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.23,0:55:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不  别过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, no, no. We are not crossing this!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.65,0:55:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我的大猫我来管  我们过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My cat, my rules. We cross!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.41,0:55:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-也许我们该投个票  -回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe we should take a vote? - Around!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.69,0:55:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,前进{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cross!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.83,0:55:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Around!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.79,0:55:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-前进  -不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cross! - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.46,0:55:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,仙蒂  过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sandy, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.01,0:55:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,真是谢谢你啊  霍普  这可真安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Hope. This is so much safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.14,0:55:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我看不到外面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't see!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.68,0:55:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,发生什么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.06,0:55:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要带我们去哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are they taking us?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.81,0:55:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,撑住  盖伊  只要我们离开这块木头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold tight, Guy. As soon as we get out of this log,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.44,0:56:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我就拳打脚踢  找回我们的自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll start swinging and punching our way to freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.90,0:56:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧  拳猴们  开始吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, punch monkeys! Let's get this on!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.21,0:56:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不只有拳猴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's-It's not just punch monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.75,0:56:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,还有脚踢猴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's kick monkeys,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.00,0:56:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,铁头猴  锤裆猴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}headbutt monkeys, low-blow monkeys,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.63,0:56:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,啃咬猴  腹肌猴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bite monkeys, ab-tight monkeys!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.67,0:56:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,肩膀拳猴  尾巴拳猴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoulders that punch! Tails that crunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.22,0:56:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,狂躁窒息猴  奇异倒挂猴  尖牙毒嘴猴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deranged stranglers! Strange danglers! Fanged manglers!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.43,0:56:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,嘴部呼吸猴  大脑碾压猴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mouth-breathers! Brain squeezers!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.76,0:56:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一个有着奇怪眼睛的家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a dude with...weird eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.16,0:57:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他们似乎在说某种原始的语言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They seem to have some kind of primitive language.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.42,0:57:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但你不会  对吧  聪明鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you can't speak it, huh, smarty-pants?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.75,0:57:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我是不会  但我肯定被关几个月后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, no. But I'm sure after a few months in captivity...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.13,0:57:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我能和他们交流  我的拳猴语说的很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can talk to them. I'm fluent in punch monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.26,0:57:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-真的吗  -这不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You are? - Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.01,0:57:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我真不想这么做  这可不是门美丽的语言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I really don't want to do this. It's not a pretty language.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.84,0:57:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰一下  我想问问{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pardon me, I'd like to ask...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.65,0:57:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-我知道了  -他说了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ooh! I see. - So, what's he saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.28,0:57:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他们很生气  因为菲尔违反了他们的合同{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're angry because Phil broke the terms of their contract!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.41,0:57:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,可笑  我们从来没有过正式协议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ludicrous! We had no formal agreement,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.59,0:57:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你们这些骗子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you chiselers!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.65,0:57:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,还有  他们想要他们的香蕉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! Also, they want their bananas.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.33,0:57:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  香蕉很好吃  但为什么管我们要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, bananas are delicious. Why is that our problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.50,0:57:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一个问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And one more question.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.01,0:57:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,很久以前  他们的世界是个天堂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Many moons ago, their world was a paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.47,0:57:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,看来这会是一个漫长的故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is gonna be a long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.84,0:57:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那是一段欢乐的时光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"It was a time of much joy."
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.31,0:57:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,河水自由地流淌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The water flowed freely.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.47,0:58:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,香蕉茂盛地生长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bananas grew in bunches.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.81,0:58:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们拥有艺术  政治{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had art, politics...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.56,0:58:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,经济{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...economics... Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.69,0:58:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但是最重要的  我们有香蕉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but most of all, bananas.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.77,0:58:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,许许多多的香蕉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So many bananas.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.07,0:58:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,接着  在满月{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then, at full moon,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.03,0:58:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,怪物来拿走了它的香蕉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the monster came for its bananas.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.91,0:58:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  美好时光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep. Good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.78,0:58:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-等等  倒回去  -对  他用了怪物这词吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait. Um, go back. - Yeah. Did he say "monster"?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.58,0:58:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们才不倒回去  就像我刚刚说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are not going back! As I was saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.25,0:58:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,美好时光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.67,0:58:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但是  出于某种奇怪原因  河水不再流淌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then, for some strange reason, the water went away.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.00,0:58:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,之后呢  香蕉也不再生长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After that, the bananas went away too.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.13,0:58:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,但是怪物可没有离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the monster didn't go away. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.68,0:58:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,它又来拿它的香蕉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It came back for its bananas.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.68,0:58:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,但没有香蕉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were no bananas.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.98,0:58:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,总的来说  他们真的需要那些香蕉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In summary, they really need those bananas.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.02,0:58:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,怪物  香蕉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monsters, bananas.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.94,0:58:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我来告诉你问题出在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you what their problem is.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.15,0:58:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的水源枯竭了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their water supply is dried up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.36,0:58:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,把我的话一字一句的告诉他们  盖伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell them this word-for-word, Guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.20,0:58:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我  菲尔·贝特曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I, Phil Betterman,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.52,0:59:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,靠一己之力就把沙漠变成了绿洲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}single-handedly turned a desert into an oasis
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.25,0:59:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,从高山上把水源引过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by diverting water from a high mountain source,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.08,0:59:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,就像是  那边  那个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}much like that... one.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.63,0:59:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  盖伊  不要翻译这句{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, Guy, don't translate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.17,0:59:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,太晚了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.18,0:59:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,都是他的错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was all him!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.59,0:59:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他偷了你们的水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He stole your water
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.46,0:59:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,吃了你们的香蕉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ate your bananas
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.17,0:59:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,毁了你们的环境{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and ruined your society!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.06,0:59:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,够了  我不会再受你们欺负了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it! I will not be pelted!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.31,0:59:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧  你们这些粗鲁的猿猴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, impertinent apes...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.90,0:59:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,让你们见识一下我脑力全开的厉害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...meet the full force of my intellect.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.61,0:59:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,让你们见到工具制造者贝特曼就感到绝望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look upon Betterman the toolmaker and despair!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.11,0:59:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,刺  刺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jab, jab.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.58,0:59:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,刺  刺  刺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jab, jab, jab.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.83,0:59:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,该走了  菲尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Way to go, Phil.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.63,0:59:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,该走了  霍普  我们跟丢了他们的气味{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Way to go, Hope. We lost the scent.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.09,0:59:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不  旅行窗户{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no! Travel window!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.47,1:00:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托  拜托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on. Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.46,1:00:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,它还能用  各位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It still works, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.63,1:00:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我们迷路了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.81,1:00:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是为什么不能跟着原始人  还有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is why you don't follow cave people. One more word out of...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.44,1:00:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们差点忘了老办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have forgotten the old ways,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.98,1:00:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这个世界和我都还年轻时的办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the ways of the world when it was young, and I was young,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.91,1:00:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那时我是一个女武士部落的族长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when I was the queen matriarch of a warrior tribe of wimmins.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.00,1:00:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,雷霆姐妹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Thunder Sisters.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.15,1:00:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,没错  雷霆姐妹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it girl. The Thunder Sisters.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.96,1:00:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们曾面对危险  打败死神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We faced down danger and kicked death in the crotch!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.63,1:00:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不需要雷霆姐妹  妈妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't need the Thunder Sisters, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.07,1:00:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要一个能找到他们的办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need a way to find the men!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.09,1:00:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,办法吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, a way?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.01,1:00:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,雷霆姐妹总能找到办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Thunder Sisters always find a way!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.22,1:00:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你还没忘记飞行吧  老丫头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think you got one more flight in you, old girl?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.39,1:00:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my goodness.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.68,1:00:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,飞吧  维格塞斯  飞吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fly, Wigasus, fly!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.90,1:00:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.53,1:00:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,去找到他们  维格塞斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go and find them, Wigasus.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.07,1:01:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我受够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is it!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.66,1:01:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都是疯子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are all crazy!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.83,1:01:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗  那个头发不会回来了  它逃了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you know what? That hair's not coming back. It escaped.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.62,1:01:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在需要做的就是  晓晓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is what we need to be doing, Dawn.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.62,1:01:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,摆脱这些疯狂的原始人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Getting away from these crazy... cave people!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.63,1:01:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.71,1:01:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不请自来闯入我们的生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You came barging into our lives uninvited,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.13,1:01:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你甚至都没有洗恶心的脚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without even wiping your disgusting... feet!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.80,1:01:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,还有这位偷窥狂桑克  和那个愚蠢的窗户{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And peeping Thunk over here, with his dumb... window.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.39,1:01:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这是给大孩子看的节目{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This show is for older kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.14,1:01:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,还有那个浑身长满跳蚤的老鼠宝宝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that flea-infested rat baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.42,1:01:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你这傻孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You dumb baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.31,1:01:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  我要杀了她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. I'm gonna kill her.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.89,1:01:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  冷静点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey, hey. Chill.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.69,1:01:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,还有你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.15,1:01:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,把我女儿带到围墙外面去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taking my daughter outside the wall,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.11,1:01:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,让她留下了伤疤  和她说了愚蠢的想法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}giving her scars and stupid ideas!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.11,1:01:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈  不要用那种方式跟我朋友说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom! Don't talk to my friend that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.36,1:01:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我很高兴盖伊能恍然大悟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm glad Guy came to his senses
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.07,1:01:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,意识到不应该和一个洞穴妹在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and realized he doesn't belong with a cave girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.28,1:01:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他应该和我们在一起  贝特曼一家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He belongs with us, the Bettermans!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.62,1:01:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走  晓晓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, Dawn!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.16,1:01:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈  你去哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.04,1:01:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我得离开这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got to get away!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.29,1:01:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,原始人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cave people!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.76,1:02:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,哦不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.85,1:02:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.52,1:02:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,小伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eep!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.57,1:02:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉他  小伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him, Eep! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.28,1:02:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-妈妈  -她在那{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mom! - There she is!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.83,1:02:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来救你了  冰雪女王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're coming for you, ice lady!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.45,1:02:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,作战队形{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill circle!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.38,1:02:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧  是时候拼刺刀了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, stabby. Time to get stabbing.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.60,1:02:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们  等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.52,1:02:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,大家放下武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone lower your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.40,1:02:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-晓晓  -她在干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dawn. - What is she doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.90,1:02:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,相信她  放下武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust her. Lower your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.86,1:03:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,到这来  小家伙  你可以出来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here, little guy. You can come out.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.82,1:03:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,对  不要怕  你可以的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. It's okay. You got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.16,1:03:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是怪兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't a monster.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.79,1:03:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,它是个母亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a mom
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.08,1:03:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,她只是担心她的孩子  想保护孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who was just afraid for her baby and being protective,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.50,1:03:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然可能有一点  粗鲁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and maybe a bit, uh, rude.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.26,1:03:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,也许她自己都没有意识到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And maybe she just didn't realize
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.26,1:03:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这些外来者并不是个威胁  而是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the outsiders weren't a threat but actually...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.43,1:03:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.89,1:03:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,而且也许{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that maybe,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.48,1:03:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,狼蛛和外来者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the wolf spiders and outsiders
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.03,1:03:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,可以在树屋里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could live in beautiful harmony together
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.23,1:03:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,和谐共处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in their tree house!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.44,1:03:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说在冰穴里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean ice cave.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.90,1:03:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你看着它们就能想到那么多吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got all that just from looking at them?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.45,1:03:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我观察世界的这扇窗户还不够{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps the window by which I view the world is flawed.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.49,1:03:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去摸摸它们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna go pet them.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.17,1:03:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,看啊  他们用牙齿拥抱我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, look, they're hugging me with their teeth!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.18,1:04:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-盖伊  -小伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Guy. - Eep?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.26,1:04:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-盖伊  -小伊  你回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Guy. - Eep, you came back!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.64,1:04:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.56,1:04:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经做了决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made your choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.15,1:04:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-不  那不是我想要的  -享受你的明天吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. That's not what I wanted! - Enjoy your... Tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.90,1:04:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,小伊  快回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eep! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.78,1:04:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.08,1:04:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,阿瓜  能安静点吗  我正在思考{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grug, do you mind? I'm trying to think!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.00,1:04:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我在想着怎么离开这里  在怪物出现以前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm trying to get out of here before that monster shows up!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.88,1:04:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,根本没有怪物  笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no monster, you bonehead.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.34,1:04:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他们只是想  吓唬我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They just want to... scare us.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.14,1:04:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.22,1:04:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是时候将恐惧化作力量对抗这些猿猴了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to strike fear into the hearts of these apes.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.15,1:05:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,让你们见到火焰制造者贝特曼就感到绝望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look upon Betterman the fire maker and despair!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.69,1:05:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,火焰  火焰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flame, flame!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.03,1:05:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,真棒  他们现在有了长矛  还有了火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. Now they have spears and fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.74,1:05:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,盖伊  他刚才把火给了这些猴子们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guy, he just gave the monkeys fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.01,1:05:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了吗  握手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ready? And shake.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.18,1:05:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,握手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. And shake!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.31,1:05:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,握手  握手  握手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And shake, and shake, and shake, and shake, and shake!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.93,1:05:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  外婆  你确定这样安全吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Gran? Are you sure this is safe?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.73,1:05:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不用担心  不会  太疼的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. It won't hurt... much.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.90,1:05:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-小伊呢  -她去找柴火了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's Eep? - She went off to get more firewood.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.40,1:05:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-我去找她  -乌格  帮帮我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm gonna go find her. - Ugga, help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.57,1:05:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,小伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eep?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.01,1:06:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.38,1:06:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.93,1:06:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是弄点柴火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just getting some firewood.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.60,1:06:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得已经够多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you've got it covered.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.68,1:06:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,跟树打了那么久  想休息会吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you wanna take a break from beating up the forest?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.15,1:06:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你想谈谈吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you ready to talk about it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.91,1:06:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我不敢相信他在我和树之间  选择了树{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe he would choose a tree over me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.87,1:06:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得事情没那么简单{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think it's that simple.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.34,1:06:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,盖伊从小就认识贝特曼一家了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guy knew the Bettermans when he was little.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.84,1:06:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是他最亲近的家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're the closest thing he has to a family.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.09,1:06:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,以前我每次受伤的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every time I've been hurt before...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.72,1:07:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,都会留下一个看得见的伤疤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've gotten a mark I can see.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.23,1:07:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这一次我伤得很厉害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This hurts so much,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.65,1:07:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,却看不见伤疤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I can't even see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.81,1:07:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我能看见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.48,1:07:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不重要了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.11,1:07:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是太不一样了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're just too different.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.70,1:07:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不在乎呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't even care.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.03,1:07:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,小伊  如果有什么东西让你很受伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eep, if something hurts this much,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.66,1:07:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那说明它是你在乎的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}maybe it means you do care.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.46,1:07:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,也许那就是你要为之战斗的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it's something worth fighting for.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.21,1:07:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,所以呢  你现在要怎么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what are you gonna do about it?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.01,1:07:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈  你确定不和我们一起睡吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, you sure you don't wanna join us?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.46,1:07:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这里真的很暖和{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's really warm in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.60,1:07:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不是抱团睡觉的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, I'm not really a sleep-pile person.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.14,1:07:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我有披肩可以保暖  好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a shawl to keep me... warm. That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.48,1:07:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以用这个旅行篮子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll just use the travel basket to shield mys...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.99,1:07:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.41,1:08:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒适  不是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's cozy, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.96,1:08:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉过你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Told ya.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.88,1:08:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  乌格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, um, Ugga?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.63,1:08:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,小伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eep?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.30,1:08:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.93,1:08:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是想说一声{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanna say, um...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.31,1:08:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前实在是太糟糕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I have been terrible.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.73,1:08:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管我做了那些事  说了那些话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After everything I did and said,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.55,1:08:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你们依然救了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you still saved me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.11,1:08:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.69,1:08:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们总是说"一家人要在一起"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we always say the pack stays together.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.11,1:08:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们的家训{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unofficial motto.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.36,1:08:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.45,1:08:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不  有关系  我太坏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. It is not okay. I was awful.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.36,1:08:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,真的没关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.08,1:08:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-我曾想从你身边夺走盖伊  -没关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I tried to steal Guy from you. - It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.08,1:08:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我还给了你一个咄咄逼人的篮子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I gave you a passive-aggressive basket.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.33,1:08:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  很奇怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that was weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.46,1:08:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,谁会那样做啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who does that?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.09,1:08:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,还有你的女儿  显然她不是老鼠宝宝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And your daughter, obviously, is not a rat baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.26,1:08:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,她很漂亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.64,1:09:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,她是个漂亮的人类宝宝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is a beautiful human baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.97,1:09:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-还有  -够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And... - Enough!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.53,1:09:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,盖伊在哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.20,1:09:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我是他的新宠物了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I'm his new pet.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.32,1:09:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,太糟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that's rough.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.70,1:09:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他说什么  盖伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's he saying, Guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.20,1:09:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,年老的智者下了命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The aged wise one has decreed,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.96,1:09:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们没有香蕉可以给怪物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because we have no bananas for the monster,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.71,1:09:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,所以  你们  将要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you will be...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.30,1:09:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来我来翻译吧  盖伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I can translate from here, Guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.80,1:09:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这个野蛮的原始人将为他们种植香蕉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're saying the oafish caveman will grow bananas for them,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.22,1:09:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,用他痛苦悔过的泪水浇灌土地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}watering the fields with his bitter tears.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.25,1:09:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,自然  他们想让我来监督{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. And naturally, they want me to supervise.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.39,1:09:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不是那么说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not what they said.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.48,1:09:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你又不会说拳猴语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't speak punch monkey.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.27,1:09:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I not?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.65,1:09:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,猴子们  我已经掌握了你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monkeys, I have mastered your
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.23,1:09:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,风趣而富有表现力的语言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}zesty and expressive language.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.86,1:10:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不  你没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you haven't.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.99,1:10:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,让我也讲点拳猴语吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me talk a little punch monkey.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.28,1:10:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,菲尔·贝特曼非常聪明  非常愚蠢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phil Betterman is so smart, he's stupid!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.12,1:10:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你要说什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, what do you have to say to this...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.75,1:10:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,要不  这事让我来解决吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? Let me fix this.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.25,1:10:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你不介意吧  能把这个给我吗  谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you mind? Can I take this? Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.67,1:10:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-不要妨碍我  -你不要妨碍我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do not interrupt me! - You stop interrupting me!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.75,1:10:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩能停下吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you two stop it?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.12,1:10:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我正在想办法帮我们离开这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to get us out of this!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.34,1:10:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我和这些猴子相处得很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in good with these monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.02,1:10:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我有了一份工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a job!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.05,1:10:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩  你们要搞砸了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you two, you're gonna mess it up!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.97,1:10:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,就像你们搞砸一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like you mess up everything!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.35,1:10:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,就像你搞砸了我美好的青少年恋情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like you messed up my beautiful teenage romance.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.48,1:10:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,盖伊  孩子  请你理解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guy, son, please understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.82,1:10:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那是阿瓜的错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Grug's fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.86,1:10:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-抓住他  盖伊  -我不是你那边的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get him, Guy! - I am not on your side!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.32,1:10:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-对啊  他是我这边的  -我也不站你这边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, he's with me! I'm not on yours either!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.71,1:10:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我认识那宽阔的肩膀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I recognize those broad shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.50,1:10:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,小伊  你来找我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Eep, you came for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.39,1:11:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.06,1:11:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去哪  菲尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where you going, Phil?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.69,1:11:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这里没有男人洞穴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No man cave here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.23,1:11:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以躲掉你的家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can hide from your family...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.85,1:11:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不过你躲不掉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but you can't hide from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.16,1:11:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  你珍视的家人们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, your precious pack...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.95,1:11:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴你走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is glad you're gone...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.96,1:11:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你让他们窒息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because you smother them.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.54,1:11:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,行  你造了一堵墙围住你的家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! Well, you built a wall around your family.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.34,1:11:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但你也在你心中造了一堵墙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you also built a wall around your heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.76,1:11:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你算什么吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what you are?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.56,1:11:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我来告诉你你算什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you what you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.14,1:11:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-你是个  -糟糕的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're... - A bad...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.56,1:11:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.44,1:12:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,话语也能当作武器吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Words as weapons?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.82,1:12:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你只不过是个洞穴妹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're just a cave girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.36,1:12:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这个叫淋浴  试试看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's called a shower. Try it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.45,1:12:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉她要洗澡  谁会做那种事啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told her to take a shower. Who does that?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.16,1:12:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,就是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.20,1:12:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,小伊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Eep.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.50,1:12:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,祝贺  菲尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations, Phil.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.12,1:12:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你正中我痛处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hit me where it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.67,1:12:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我也一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Likewise.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.38,1:12:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  菲尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Phil! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.38,1:12:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,听得见吗  阿瓜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Grug!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.76,1:12:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,阿瓜  我是产生幻觉了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grug, am I hallucinating?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.26,1:12:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,没  盖伊变成了巨型香蕉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Guy's a giant banana.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.47,1:12:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,猴子们刚刚要说的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the monkeys were trying to say
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.64,1:12:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会在月圆之夜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was that we're gonna be sacrificed
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.50,1:12:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,被献祭给怪物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the monster at full moon tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.94,1:12:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,她还在外面等着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's still waiting out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.70,1:12:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我不确定她的头发会回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure her hair is coming back.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.58,1:13:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我睡了多久了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh. How long was I out for?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.96,1:13:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都瞅啥呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you guys all staring at?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.22,1:13:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.26,1:13:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你的头发  狂野凌乱  我爱它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your hair! It's massive and wild, and I love it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.60,1:13:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.31,1:13:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,外婆  你的头发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gran, your hair!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.65,1:13:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,啥  这只是暂时的造型{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? It's temporary.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.65,1:13:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不  它在朝我们飞过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! It's flying this way!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.02,1:13:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,维格塞斯回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wigasus has returned!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.74,1:13:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,滚开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get off me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.04,1:13:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,说重点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get to the point.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.42,1:13:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,拳猴  我恨拳猴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Punch monkeys. I hate punch monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.09,1:13:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,维格塞斯说男人们被带去那边了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wigasus says the men have been taken over yonder.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.22,1:13:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,很好  计划是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. What's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.30,1:13:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,雷霆姐妹会怎么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would the Thunder Sisters do?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.18,1:14:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,没错  雷霆姐妹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw. All right, Thunder Sisters!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.35,1:14:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们要去解救那些男人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we're gonna rescue these men,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.35,1:14:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就需要某些东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's something we're gonna need.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.69,1:14:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-窗户  -错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A window? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.90,1:14:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-朗朗上口的口号  -错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A catchy chant? - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.99,1:14:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,彼此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.07,1:14:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,"彼"什么  错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Each" what? No!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.66,1:14:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,新的部落名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New tribe names.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.41,1:14:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,仙蒂  你应该叫"搜寻者"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sandy, you shall be called "Seeker."
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.16,1:14:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,小伊  "火焰之心"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eep, "Fire Heart."
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.91,1:14:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,乌格  "血色号角"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ugga, "Blood Horn."
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.66,1:14:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,桑克  你是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thunk, you're...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.17,1:14:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,就叫"桑克"吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Thunk."
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.33,1:14:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我不记得名字的聪明女孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smart girl whose name I don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.50,1:14:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-我叫晓晓  -错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm Dawn. - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.67,1:14:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫"日落姐妹"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are "Sister Sunset."
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.71,1:14:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,还有你是"沼泽之水"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you are "Bog Water."
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.51,1:14:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我的名字是"沼泽之水"吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name's "Bog Water"?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.97,1:14:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,在你有炫酷头发前就想好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought of it before you had cool hair.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.93,1:14:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我乃沼泽之水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Bog Water!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.10,1:14:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-嘿  日落姐妹  -怎么了  火焰之心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Sister Sunset. - Yeah, Fire Heart?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.06,1:14:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-你看见那些狼蛛了吗  -看见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You see those wolf spiders? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.19,1:14:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-想要骑它们吗  -是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wanna ride them? - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.86,1:14:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-雷霆姐妹  -雷霆姐妹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thunder Sisters. - Thunder Sisters!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.07,1:14:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,雷霆姐妹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thunder Sister!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.20,1:14:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,雷霆姐妹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thunder Sisters!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.02,1:15:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,进我嘴里了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it went in my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.83,1:15:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.29,1:15:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜这就是我们的结局了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess this is it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.84,1:15:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,菲尔  抱歉我吃了你的香蕉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phil, I'm sorry I ate your bananas.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.26,1:15:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我想也许我也做了错事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose perhaps I have made mistakes too.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.22,1:16:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-比如给猴子提供了武器吗  -是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Like weaponizing these monkeys? - Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.52,1:16:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,或者偷了它们的水源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or stealing their water?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.10,1:16:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,还有教它们打这些结{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And teaching them to tie these knots?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.94,1:16:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,它们打的结烂透了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, their knots were atrocious!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.44,1:16:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我只希望我能再看小伊一眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wish that I'd been able to see Eep one more time.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.91,1:16:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我耗尽我一生去寻找{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I spent my whole life searching
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.48,1:16:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,一个我父母想要我找到的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for a place my parents wanted me to find,
