Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.72,1:24:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.13,1:24:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.36,1:24:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我想我爱你  生活不就是由此构成吗 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I think I love you, Isn't that what life is made of? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.20,1:24:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.33,1:24:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,小伊  不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eep! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.62,1:24:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.88,1:24:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗  那可不是我真的脚趾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? That's not my real toe.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.34,1:25:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我想我爱你  生活不就是由此构成吗 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I think I love you, Isn't that what life is made of? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.85,1:25:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你从没跟我说过这件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never told me about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.31,1:25:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-你知道她有个花生脚趾吗  -不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you know she had a peanut toe? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.99,1:25:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,旅行日志{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Travel log...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.32,1:25:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,最终篇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}final entry.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.07,1:25:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,经历了我一生中最长  最可怕的两个月夜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After two of the longest, most terrifying moons in my life,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.74,1:25:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,克鲁德家族和贝特曼家族重新和好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Croods and the Bettermans made it back together.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.92,1:25:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,道格拉斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Douglas?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.11,1:25:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,道格拉斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Douglas!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.20,1:25:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,道格拉斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Douglas!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.22,1:25:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,贝特曼一家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the Bettermans
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.13,1:25:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎大家待在这  永远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}welcomed everyone to stay... forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.10,1:25:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们在农场周围做了一些改动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we made a few changes around the farm.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.39,1:25:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-这样视野开阔可多了  -可不是嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, it really opens up the place. - Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.27,1:25:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,拳猴们也搬到了我们隔壁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and the punch monkeys moved in next door.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.27,1:25:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计  它们经常开派对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, do they party a lot!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.61,1:25:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,整日  整夜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All day, all night.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.61,1:26:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,菲尔真的学会了说拳猴语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phil actually learned to speak punch monkey.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.41,1:26:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,行  我会给你我的独家食谱  别担心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. I'll get you that recipe. Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.24,1:26:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,而阿瓜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Grug...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.33,1:26:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,再来一遍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come again?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.41,1:26:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他还在刻苦钻研呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he's still working on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.50,1:26:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,再来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One more time.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.62,1:26:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝  快进到最精彩的部分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, babe. Get to the good part!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.46,1:26:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,对  对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah. Right!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.34,1:26:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这些还不是唯一的变化{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those weren't the only changes.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.88,1:26:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的会非常想你们的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm really gonna miss you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.34,1:26:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你需要我们  你妈妈和我一直都在这{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mother and I are here if you need us.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.55,1:26:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boom?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.55,1:26:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boom.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.72,1:26:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,过来抱抱  儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in here, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.31,1:26:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,再见  爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.73,1:26:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的宝贝女儿离开了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our baby's leaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.77,1:26:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的宝贝女儿离开我们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our baby's leaving!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.91,1:26:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,击掌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boomsies?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.95,1:26:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,击掌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boom.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.45,1:26:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,大家  快看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.21,1:26:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,仙蒂会说话了  她说"击掌"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sandy said her first word! Sandy said, "Boomsies!"
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.84,1:27:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-嘿  -嘿  怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey. - Hey, what?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.30,1:27:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿  美女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.76,1:27:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,外婆  你换了新发型吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gran, did you do something new with your hair?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.98,1:27:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这个吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, this?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.27,1:27:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,维格塞斯请了两天假  我试试新的假发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wigasus took the day off, so I'm trying a new do.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.48,1:27:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,桑克  别把窗户拿到桌上来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thunk, no window at the table.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.82,1:27:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,有谁饿了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's hungry?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.03,1:27:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一道特殊的料理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a special dish
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.02,1:27:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们称它为香蕉兄弟面包{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we call Bronana Bread.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.32,1:27:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲担心家人会变得越来越少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father was afraid of the pack getting smaller.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.78,1:27:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但最后  变得越来越多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But in the end, it got bigger.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.70,1:27:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,非常多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A whole lot bigger.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.54,1:27:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,终究爸爸是对的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad was right after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.33,1:27:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,一家人在一起会更强大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were stronger together.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.34,1:27:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我们正聊着天 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ We're talking ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.47,1:27:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我正睡着  正做着一个美梦 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I was sleeping, And right in the middle of a good dream ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.10,1:27:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 突然间我醒了 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Like all at once I wake up ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.40,1:27:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 有东西一直在敲打我的脑袋 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ From something That keeps knocking at my brain ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.90,1:28:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 在发疯之前  我会把枕头按在头上 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Before I go insane I hold my pillow to my head ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.70,1:28:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 从床上跳起来  尖叫着我不敢说的话 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ And spring up in my bed, Screaming out the words I dread ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.57,1:28:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我想我爱你 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I think I love you ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.54,1:28:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我想我爱你  那我到底在害怕什么 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I think I love you, So what am I so afraid of? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.46,1:28:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我怕我不能确定 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I'm afraid that I'm not sure of ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.46,1:28:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 可爱情没有解药 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ A love there is no cure for ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.05,1:28:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我想我爱你  生活不就是由此构成吗 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I think I love you Isn't that what life is made of? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.05,1:28:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 尽管我不想说 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Though it worries me to say ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.52,1:28:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我从未有过这种感觉 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I've never felt this way ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.39,1:28:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我必须告诉你一件我想了很久 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I have to tell you something I've been thinking ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.81,1:28:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 却没有勇气说出口的事 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ for a long time but didn't have the courage to say. ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.65,1:28:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我想我爱你 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I think I love you. ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.48,1:28:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 你知道吗  从头说一次  我真的爱你 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ You know what? Scratch that. I do love you. ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.44,1:28:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我不知道我面对的是什么 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I don't know what I'm up against ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.36,1:28:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我不知道这是怎么回事 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I don't know what it's all about ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.82,1:28:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我考虑了很多事情 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I got so much to think about ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.08,1:28:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我想我爱你  那我到底在害怕什么 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I think I love you, So what am I so afraid of? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.04,1:29:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我怕我不能确定  可爱情没有解药 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I'm afraid that I'm not sure of a love there is no cure for ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.25,1:29:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我快要疯了 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I'm going crazy! ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.76,1:29:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我想我爱你 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I think I love you ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.47,1:29:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 生活不就是由此构成吗 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Isn't that what life is made of? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.68,1:29:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 尽管我不想说  我从未有过这种感觉 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Though it worries me to say I've never felt this way ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.64,1:29:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 相信我 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Believe me ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.02,1:29:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 你真的不用担心 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ You really don't have to worry ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.19,1:29:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我只想让你开心 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I only wanna make you happy ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.56,1:29:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 如果你说你离我远点  我就会离开 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ And if you say, "Hey, go away," I will ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.07,1:29:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 但我想我还是会留在你身边继续爱你 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ But I think better still I'd better stay around and love you ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.40,1:29:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 你看我有机会吗 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Do you think I have a case ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.62,1:29:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 让我面对面问问你 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Let me ask you to your face ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.78,1:29:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 你觉得你爱我吗 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Do you think you love me? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.20,1:29:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我想我爱你 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I think I love you ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.69,1:29:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我想我爱你 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I think I love you ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.32,1:29:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我想我爱你 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I think I love you ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.30,1:29:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我想我爱你 ∮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I think I love you ∮
